{
  "schema_version": "text-light-input-1.0",
  "unit_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_u01",
  "video_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac",
  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君你相信吗，过劳者亡，过慧者天收，人生最大的智慧在于知止。我们将在8月23日迎来处暑节气，处就是止的意思，处暑，就是暑气至此即将结束，暑若不止，秋则不至。#处暑节气 #非遗 #秋天 #入秋",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 171.711905,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱君，你相信吗？过劳者，亡过，惠者添收。人生最大的智慧在于知止。我们将在八月二十三日迎来楚暑节气，楚就是止的意思。楚暑就是暑期至此，即将结暑，暑若不止秋则不至，你知道吗？李嘉诚之所以能够成为我身后的香港首富，是因为他的办公室后面挂了两个字。那就是知止。真正的强者从来不会站在山顶跳舞，而是在距离悬崖三步之时转身离开。什么叫知止啊？沉默成本不参与重大决策，已有损失，不影响当前角色。这句话不管放在什么地方都适合。比如你看电影看了中途觉得不好看了，那就立马离开。至于买电影票花了多少钱，打算花了多少钱等等，这些都不能影响你的角色。无论任何关系，当你决定离开时，就一定是当下最好的结果。不要因为可惜曾经的付出而委委曲求全。人活几个瞬间，但不能只活几个瞬间，明智的放弃，好过，盲目执着。楚楚节气有三后，一后应乃静鸟二后天地使速。三后何乃登天地始速意味着自然由繁盛转向收敛秩序开始重新出现。一个人的好运往往从清场开始，你知道吗？农历七月是交界的月，阳气开始收敛，阴气逐渐上升。国语说，七月流火，很多重要的日子都在这个月要多一分敬畏。从夏天的火运转到秋天的金运，一定要收敛神气。在传统文化，中秋对应的金代表着收敛裁决，所谓秋后算账，秋天的天时，就是让你做舍弃，不舍就不得有舍才有得这就是今生水。人们会在秋天砍掉果树没用的杈，这样来年才会丰收。秋天收了冬天才有的藏，来年春天才能生发。秋后就得算算账，消耗你的人要断低回报的事要清。一清攒了好久的塑料袋，多年不穿的旧衣服都扔一扔，大胆的扔离里数云散，袅袅凉风起，给人生设一个除暑吧。很多人真正的问题已经不是不够努力，而是不知道什么时候该停。明知一段关系没有回应，还在不停的付出。明知一件事，只剩沉默成本，还在不甘心的坚持。明知身体已经透支，还要用疲惫证明上进，不要等生活把你耗尽，才允许自己停下楚楚。最好的祝福是情绪有止，欲望有度，关系有界努力。有些愿你在季节的转身处，告别盛夏的燥热与疲惫，收获初秋的清爽与从容。愿你所念，皆如愿，所行皆坦途。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 710,
      "text": "朱君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00002",
      "start_ms": 950,
      "end_ms": 1710,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1890,
      "end_ms": 2670,
      "text": "过劳者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00004",
      "start_ms": 2670,
      "end_ms": 3330,
      "text": "亡过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00005",
      "start_ms": 3330,
      "end_ms": 4170,
      "text": "惠者添收。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00006",
      "start_ms": 4630,
      "end_ms": 6930,
      "text": "人生最大的智慧在于知止。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00007",
      "start_ms": 7590,
      "end_ms": 10630,
      "text": "我们将在八月二十三日迎来楚暑节气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11210,
      "end_ms": 12910,
      "text": "楚就是止的意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00009",
      "start_ms": 13310,
      "end_ms": 15490,
      "text": "楚暑就是暑期至此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15650,
      "end_ms": 16570,
      "text": "即将结暑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00011",
      "start_ms": 17090,
      "end_ms": 19310,
      "text": "暑若不止秋则不至，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19910,
      "end_ms": 20630,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20770,
      "end_ms": 23550,
      "text": "李嘉诚之所以能够成为我身后的香港首富，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23830,
      "end_ms": 26190,
      "text": "是因为他的办公室后面挂了两个字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00015",
      "start_ms": 26330,
      "end_ms": 27690,
      "text": "那就是知止。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00016",
      "start_ms": 28430,
      "end_ms": 31200,
      "text": "真正的强者从来不会站在山顶跳舞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00017",
      "start_ms": 31300,
      "end_ms": 34300,
      "text": "而是在距离悬崖三步之时转身离开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00018",
      "start_ms": 34800,
      "end_ms": 35980,
      "text": "什么叫知止啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00019",
      "start_ms": 36280,
      "end_ms": 38560,
      "text": "沉默成本不参与重大决策，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00020",
      "start_ms": 38580,
      "end_ms": 39340,
      "text": "已有损失，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00021",
      "start_ms": 39340,
      "end_ms": 40700,
      "text": "不影响当前角色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00022",
      "start_ms": 41000,
      "end_ms": 43340,
      "text": "这句话不管放在什么地方都适合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43700,
      "end_ms": 46160,
      "text": "比如你看电影看了中途觉得不好看了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00024",
      "start_ms": 46320,
      "end_ms": 47400,
      "text": "那就立马离开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00025",
      "start_ms": 47600,
      "end_ms": 49200,
      "text": "至于买电影票花了多少钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00026",
      "start_ms": 49240,
      "end_ms": 50580,
      "text": "打算花了多少钱等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00027",
      "start_ms": 50680,
      "end_ms": 52480,
      "text": "这些都不能影响你的角色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00028",
      "start_ms": 52720,
      "end_ms": 53860,
      "text": "无论任何关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00029",
      "start_ms": 53980,
      "end_ms": 55420,
      "text": "当你决定离开时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00030",
      "start_ms": 55460,
      "end_ms": 57280,
      "text": "就一定是当下最好的结果。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00031",
      "start_ms": 57520,
      "end_ms": 60795,
      "text": "不要因为可惜曾经的付出而委委曲求全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00032",
      "start_ms": 61310,
      "end_ms": 62555,
      "text": "人活几个瞬间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00033",
      "start_ms": 62740,
      "end_ms": 64355,
      "text": "但不能只活几个瞬间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00034",
      "start_ms": 64740,
      "end_ms": 65700,
      "text": "明智的放弃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00035",
      "start_ms": 65760,
      "end_ms": 66160,
      "text": "好过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00036",
      "start_ms": 66240,
      "end_ms": 67125,
      "text": "盲目执着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00037",
      "start_ms": 67510,
      "end_ms": 68785,
      "text": "楚楚节气有三后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00038",
      "start_ms": 69080,
      "end_ms": 72020,
      "text": "一后应乃静鸟二后天地使速。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00039",
      "start_ms": 72200,
      "end_ms": 79345,
      "text": "三后何乃登天地始速意味着自然由繁盛转向收敛秩序开始重新出现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00040",
      "start_ms": 79770,
      "end_ms": 82455,
      "text": "一个人的好运往往从清场开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00041",
      "start_ms": 82780,
      "end_ms": 83380,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00042",
      "start_ms": 83380,
      "end_ms": 85215,
      "text": "农历七月是交界的月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00043",
      "start_ms": 85460,
      "end_ms": 86620,
      "text": "阳气开始收敛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00044",
      "start_ms": 86760,
      "end_ms": 88040,
      "text": "阴气逐渐上升。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00045",
      "start_ms": 88240,
      "end_ms": 88820,
      "text": "国语说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00046",
      "start_ms": 88960,
      "end_ms": 89995,
      "text": "七月流火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00047",
      "start_ms": 90340,
      "end_ms": 93395,
      "text": "很多重要的日子都在这个月要多一分敬畏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00048",
      "start_ms": 93770,
      "end_ms": 96350,
      "text": "从夏天的火运转到秋天的金运，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00049",
      "start_ms": 96390,
      "end_ms": 97855,
      "text": "一定要收敛神气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00050",
      "start_ms": 98330,
      "end_ms": 99070,
      "text": "在传统文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00051",
      "start_ms": 99070,
      "end_ms": 102030,
      "text": "中秋对应的金代表着收敛裁决，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00052",
      "start_ms": 102290,
      "end_ms": 103625,
      "text": "所谓秋后算账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00053",
      "start_ms": 104010,
      "end_ms": 105010,
      "text": "秋天的天时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00054",
      "start_ms": 105130,
      "end_ms": 106435,
      "text": "就是让你做舍弃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00055",
      "start_ms": 106760,
      "end_ms": 110725,
      "text": "不舍就不得有舍才有得这就是今生水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00056",
      "start_ms": 111170,
      "end_ms": 113725,
      "text": "人们会在秋天砍掉果树没用的杈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00057",
      "start_ms": 114020,
      "end_ms": 115485,
      "text": "这样来年才会丰收。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00058",
      "start_ms": 115920,
      "end_ms": 117780,
      "text": "秋天收了冬天才有的藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00059",
      "start_ms": 118100,
      "end_ms": 119855,
      "text": "来年春天才能生发。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00060",
      "start_ms": 120360,
      "end_ms": 121685,
      "text": "秋后就得算算账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00061",
      "start_ms": 122010,
      "end_ms": 124970,
      "text": "消耗你的人要断低回报的事要清。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00062",
      "start_ms": 124970,
      "end_ms": 126770,
      "text": "一清攒了好久的塑料袋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00063",
      "start_ms": 126830,
      "end_ms": 128930,
      "text": "多年不穿的旧衣服都扔一扔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00064",
      "start_ms": 129090,
      "end_ms": 131370,
      "text": "大胆的扔离里数云散，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00065",
      "start_ms": 131610,
      "end_ms": 132975,
      "text": "袅袅凉风起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00066",
      "start_ms": 133300,
      "end_ms": 135215,
      "text": "给人生设一个除暑吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00067",
      "start_ms": 135660,
      "end_ms": 138280,
      "text": "很多人真正的问题已经不是不够努力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00068",
      "start_ms": 138380,
      "end_ms": 140265,
      "text": "而是不知道什么时候该停。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00069",
      "start_ms": 140810,
      "end_ms": 142350,
      "text": "明知一段关系没有回应，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00070",
      "start_ms": 142350,
      "end_ms": 143525,
      "text": "还在不停的付出。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00071",
      "start_ms": 143840,
      "end_ms": 144660,
      "text": "明知一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00072",
      "start_ms": 144680,
      "end_ms": 146120,
      "text": "只剩沉默成本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00073",
      "start_ms": 146260,
      "end_ms": 147655,
      "text": "还在不甘心的坚持。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00074",
      "start_ms": 147990,
      "end_ms": 149570,
      "text": "明知身体已经透支，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00075",
      "start_ms": 149570,
      "end_ms": 151605,
      "text": "还要用疲惫证明上进，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00076",
      "start_ms": 152080,
      "end_ms": 153500,
      "text": "不要等生活把你耗尽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00077",
      "start_ms": 153580,
      "end_ms": 155660,
      "text": "才允许自己停下楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00078",
      "start_ms": 155660,
      "end_ms": 157795,
      "text": "最好的祝福是情绪有止，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00079",
      "start_ms": 158070,
      "end_ms": 158910,
      "text": "欲望有度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00080",
      "start_ms": 159170,
      "end_ms": 160940,
      "text": "关系有界努力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00081",
      "start_ms": 160940,
      "end_ms": 163440,
      "text": "有些愿你在季节的转身处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00082",
      "start_ms": 163600,
      "end_ms": 165580,
      "text": "告别盛夏的燥热与疲惫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00083",
      "start_ms": 165760,
      "end_ms": 167720,
      "text": "收获初秋的清爽与从容。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d5f761aabb8d5ac_s00084",
      "start_ms": 167960,
      "end_ms": 169080,
